#. <CLT 23>そのプレゼントは渡す事ができません。<CLT>
#. <CLT 3>“重要アイテム”<CLT><CLT 23>ですので…<CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sorry, but we can't let you give him that. It's what\n"
"we in the industry like to call a<CLT> <CLT 3>key item<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>渡すプレゼントを選択してくださいませ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>What would you like to give him?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 貰える物はすべて貰う！
#. それが、葉隠康比呂の流儀だべ！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'll take whatever I can get my hands on! That's just\n"
"my style, man!"
msgstr ""

#. こいつは質屋に入れたら、
#. おいくらの値段が付くでしょうかね？
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I wonder how much I could get for this at the pawn\n"
"shop..."
msgstr ""

#. いやはや、楽しみだべ。
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Kidding, kidding! I appreciate it, really!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しは喜んでくれたかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean he liked it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おう、苗木っち！　気がきくな！
#. ありがたく受け取っておくべ！！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That's real nice of you, man! I'll gladly take it."
msgstr ""

#. うおっ！　前から欲しかったんだべ！！
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whoa! I've always wanted one of these!"
msgstr ""

#. 神様、仏様、苗木様～！
#. この、ご恩は当分は忘れません！
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"My God, my Buddha, my Makoto! I'll never forget what\n"
"you've done for me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>良かった。
#. どうやら喜んでくれたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I get the impression that he liked it. That's good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ギャー！　この神秘的なパワー！
#. ホンマモンのオーパーツじゃないですか？
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Guwaaah! Such mysterious power... This is a true-blue\n"
"OOPart!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木さん！　夜明けは近いぜよ！
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Makoto! The dawn of a new era draws near!"
msgstr ""

#. え！？　くれんの！？
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh!? You're sayin' I can have this?"
msgstr ""

#. 一気に目が覚めたべ！　一気に元気でたべ！
#. 一気に苗木っちが好きになったべ！！
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"All of a sudden I feel invigorated! I feel awake! I\n"
"feel like I like you!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここまで喜んでもらえると、
#. あげたこっちも嬉しくなるよな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing Hiro so pleased with something I gave him makes\n"
"me happy!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 貰える物はすべて貰う。
#. それが、葉隠康比呂の流儀だべ！
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'll take whatever I can get my hands on! That's just\n"
"my style, man!"
msgstr ""

#. だが、これはいらん！！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But actually...I don't want this!"
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木っち…
#. こんなん渡されてもリアクションに困んべ…
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, boy, gee, uh...I don't know what to say..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しまった…
#. がっかりさせちゃったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... I don't think he was too happy with that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 見事に価値がわからん！
#. よって、俺には必要ないと判断すんべ！！
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I have no idea what this is worth. So I guess it's not\n"
"worth anything!"
msgstr ""

#. いらんべ…
#. 俺には無意味なモンだって…
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "This doesn't mean anything to me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怒らせちゃったみたいだ…
#. 印象が悪くなっちゃったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I made him mad. He probably thinks worse of\n"
"me now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり渡す
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Maybe not..."
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼントを渡さなくてもよろしいですか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Are you sure you don't want to give him something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
